# Strata Engine — Repository Maintenance Plan (40 Sections)

---

## 1. `CMakeLists.txt` — Top-Level Build Configuration

**Responsibilities:** Defines all build targets (`strata_artifact`, `strata_plan`, `strata_core`, `strata_kernels`, `strata_engine`, `strata_prefill`, `strata_spec`, `strata_kernels_cpu`), CUDA/HIP backend selection, warning flags, test registration, and the FetchContent dependency on llama.cpp/ggml.

**Proposed change:** The `strata_kernels` target lists 50+ `.cu` source files inline. As the project grows, this becomes unmaintainable and error-prone (duplicate entries, missing files). Replace the inline list with a `file(GLOB_RECURSE ...)` scoped to `src/kernels/cuda/`, with an explicit exclusion list for files that should not be compiled (e.g., test-only kernels). This also makes adding a new kernel a single file-drop operation.

